s expected demand, an extra unit eventually sells only about half the time.\n- That makes it worth about 0.5 × 13 = 6.5, while it costs 7 plus holding. So ordering more than expected demand loses money.\n- Candidate 3 supplies about 1,284 units from day 2 onward, matching the expected 1,281.\n- Candidate 6 adds about 46 units and loses roughly 150–200 on them.\n- Candidate 4 adds about 240 units, which is a large loss. The excess also piles up toward the 236-unit limit.\n\n*Product 1* expires after 4 days. A little extra stock helps slightly here, since a sale is worth 11 against about 5 for a wasted unit. Candidate 6's extra 2 units per order gains only about 30. Candidate 4's extra 9 units per order is too much.\n\n**3. Overall ranking.** Candidate 3 comes out ahead of 6, which beats 2 and 5. Those beat 0 and 7, then 4, then 1."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 356, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5754, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 356}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-26T08:21:38.195Z", "request_id": "req_011CgQXCdLmustgPniWugMiA"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01Qosq2yCAYevxcgCBpwxSd2", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgQXCdc8tK13rV7kAz4xV", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01Qosq2yCAYevxcgCBpwxSd2", "name": "Struct